    "detailed_description": "The story background of the game is to realize the dream of traveling around the world. Earn money by delivering takeout and purchase tickets for global travel. In the process of realizing dreams, various difficulties and obstacles will be encountered. For example, during the process of delivering takeout, one may collide with pedestrians or be hit by a car, resulting in a wasted day. There is also competition among peers, where everyone is vying for the Number One and receiving generous rewards. The game provides various modes of transportation for delivering food, including even armored vehicles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you run a red light or exceed the speed limit during delivery, it will trigger police pursuit. If you successfully escape police pursuit, you can also receive certain rewards. In the game, you can also earn rewards by purchasing lottery tickets or doing something helpful.",
    "about_the_game": "The story background of the game is to realize the dream of traveling around the world. Earn money by delivering takeout and purchase tickets for global travel. In the process of realizing dreams, various difficulties and obstacles will be encountered. For example, during the process of delivering takeout, one may collide with pedestrians or be hit by a car, resulting in a wasted day. There is also competition among peers, where everyone is vying for the Number One and receiving generous rewards. The game provides various modes of transportation for delivering food, including even armored vehicles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you run a red light or exceed the speed limit during delivery, it will trigger police pursuit. If you successfully escape police pursuit, you can also receive certain rewards. In the game, you can also earn rewards by purchasing lottery tickets or doing something helpful.",
